5,1,1,talk,Servas,,I believe we should start by understanding the human element. I will look into the staffing rolls for technical posts and the minutes on secondments and crew strength.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,I'll focus on the financial side of things. I would like to examine the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers and the national computing agreement and facility day rates.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to see how the shared tools are doing! I'll check the incident logs on shared instrumentation and the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"To ensure we aren't blindsided by systemic delays, I shall examine the portfolio review of schedule overruns and the station records from partner field sites.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the closeout files of finished awards and the national repository deposit turnaround.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Does anyone else feel that we have covered the most critical bases, or is there a specific overlap we should consider before we proceed?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I think we have a very comprehensive spread. We are looking at people, money, infrastructure, and past performance, which should give us a balanced view.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I agree! It feels like we're covering everything from the big machines to the people running them. I'm excited to see what we find!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, the distribution is quite logical. I suspect our findings will reveal whether the current environment is actually conducive to the ambitions of the proposals we are reviewing.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I agree. There is no need for further adjustment.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Since we are all in agreement, I believe we can conclude this round and move toward the investigation phase.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,I'm happy to move forward. I look forward to hearing what everyone discovers.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Kenji,,Me too! Let's get to it!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I shall concur. Let us proceed to the data.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
